    "text": "Might see an uptick in good ole American manufacturing here. I wonder how this will impact say, Toyota, which produces a large number of cars in the United States but some in Canada and some in Japan.\nFor the Tacomas, you have the beds and the engines made in the USA. I bet you see the whole vehicle come back to the USA. They already make the Camry, RAV4s, Tundras, and the Highlanders in the USA.\nI definitely saw Chinese cars when I was recently in Mexico--namely BYDs.",
